    "show_share": true,
    "description": "\"Osteoporosis is thinning and weakening of bones and affects all of us as we age involving both men and women,\" revealed Dr Mirza Rehman Beg, Associate Professor and Consultant Orthopedic Surgeon at the Aga Khan University Hospital (AKUH). He was giving a presentation on \"Osteoporosis - The Silent Bone Killer\" at 'Signs, Symptoms and Care' monthly health awareness programme held on May 13, 2000.",
